{"id":"85ef85f035e9b2d4","group":"58","path":"58/batch10/58-df-angle-preserving.md","title":"Angle Preserving","display":"df-angle-preserving — Angle Preserving","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-angle-preserving","aliases":["58-df-angle-preserving"],"display":"df-angle-preserving — Angle Preserving","depends_on":["[[../batch07/58-df-differential.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-riemannian-manifold.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-angle-preserving"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-angle-preserving</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-angle-preserving — Angle Preserving"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8e70eff045618bab\" href=\"?note=8e70eff045618bab\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-differential.md\">../batch07/58-df-differential.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"04b9f5c6479b7ecd\" href=\"?note=04b9f5c6479b7ecd\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-riemannian-manifold.md\">../batch07/58-df-riemannian-manifold.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,N,f,g,h\\in V\">\\(M,N,f,g,h\\in V\\)</span>, where <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\">\\(h\\)</span> are metric-tensor data on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\">\\(N\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Differential}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Differential}_S\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RiemannianManifold}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{RiemannianManifold}_S\\)</span> are the predicates from the cited dependencies.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AnglePreserving}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{AnglePreserving}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}angle\\text{-}preserving}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{AnglePreserving}_S(f,M,N,g,h)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{RiemannianManifold}_S(M,g)\n\\land\\operatorname{RiemannianManifold}_S(N,h)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,M,N)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall p\\in M\\;\\exists L\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Differential}_S(L,f,p)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad{}\\land\\forall u,v\\in T_pM\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\Bigl(\nL(u)\\neq0\\land L(v)\\neq0\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\quad{}\\land\n\\frac{h_{f(p)}(L(u),L(v))}\n{\\sqrt{h_{f(p)}(L(u),L(u))h_{f(p)}(L(v),L(v))}}\n=\n\\frac{g_p(u,v)}\n{\\sqrt{g_p(u,u)g_p(v,v)}}\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}angle\\text{-}preserving}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{AnglePreserving}_S(f,M,N,g,h)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{RiemannianManifold}_S(M,g)\n\\land\\operatorname{RiemannianManifold}_S(N,h)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,M,N)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall p\\in M\\;\\exists L\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Differential}_S(L,f,p)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad{}\\land\\forall u,v\\in T_pM\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\Bigl(\nL(u)\\neq0\\land L(v)\\neq0\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\quad{}\\land\n\\frac{h_{f(p)}(L(u),L(v))}\n{\\sqrt{h_{f(p)}(L(u),L(u))h_{f(p)}(L(v),L(v))}}\n=\n\\frac{g_p(u,v)}\n{\\sqrt{g_p(u,u)g_p(v,v)}}\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The former angle functions were unconstrained extra data. The predicate now derives angles from the two certified Riemannian metrics by equality of normalized inner products.</li>\n<li>Requiring nonzero differential images makes every displayed denominator positive.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch07/58-df-differential.md","status":"resolved","id":"8e70eff045618bab","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-differential.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-riemannian-manifold.md","status":"resolved","id":"04b9f5c6479b7ecd","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-riemannian-manifold.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M,N,f,g,h\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"g","display":false},{"tex":"h","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Differential}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{RiemannianManifold}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AnglePreserving}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}angle\\text{-}preserving}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{AnglePreserving}_S(f,M,N,g,h)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\operatorname{RiemannianManifold}_S(M,g)\n\\land\\operatorname{RiemannianManifold}_S(N,h)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,M,N)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall p\\in M\\;\\exists L\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Differential}_S(L,f,p)\\\\\n&\\qquad{}\\land\\forall u,v\\in T_pM\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\Bigl(\nL(u)\\neq0\\land L(v)\\neq0\\\\\n&\\qquad\\quad{}\\land\n\\frac{h_{f(p)}(L(u),L(v))}\n{\\sqrt{h_{f(p)}(L(u),L(u))h_{f(p)}(L(v),L(v))}}\n=\n\\frac{g_p(u,v)}\n{\\sqrt{g_p(u,u)g_p(v,v)}}\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1521,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-134","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-angle-preserving.md|58-df-angle-preserving]]（batch10）"}],"outgoing":["8e70eff045618bab","04b9f5c6479b7ecd","36d7463d215be751"]}